Pruza
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 12 ROTATE 3 U U
ZAEDUD 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ZAEDUD 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ZAEDUD 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ZAEDUD 1 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
ZAEDUD 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

UDA 8 FACE_ALL
UDA 9 FACE_ALL
UDA 3 FACE_ALL
UDA 7 FACE_ALL
UDA 6 FACE_ALL
UDA 7 FACE_ALL
UDA 2 FACE_ALL
UDA 4 FACE_ALL

COLUMN 4 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 10 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 3 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 2 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE ZAEDUD UDA
OR
    AND
        SRC Rank K
        SRC Suit {SPADES, CLUBS}
    DESTSRC Rank add_13
MOVE_STACK ZAEDUD ZAEDUD
OR
    SRCSTACK Size < 10
    DESTSRC Suit match_color
MOVE_STACK COLUMN UDA
DESTSRC Rank equal
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL ZAEDUD Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
